---
description: >-
  notes and members draw a leading "- " and backticks as written; relation
  labels read bold and italic; cardinalities are plain; an unknown entity
  name stays as written (#763, D559, D562)
---
classDiagram
  class A["An **important** class"] {
    +run() `fast`
  }
  class B
  A "1..*" --> "*" B : uses B *often*
  note for A "- a note item\nunknown #bogus; stays, #colon; draws"
  note "`code` in a note"
